            bad1:{text:`<p><b>Missed deadline.</b> Retyping by hand took too long and you missed one occurrence on page 3. Try again and use the software's editing tools.</p>`, end:'bad'},
            bad2:{text:`<p><b>New errors.</b> "Established 2025" in the footer and a 2025 claim date both changed wrongly. Replace All needs a precise search phrase and a check. Try again.</p>`, end:'bad'},
